# 03: Migrate server composition

**Blocked by:** 01
**Status:** open

## Delivery

Server startup obtains its configured provider through application composition.

## Design context

This consumer preserves [provider behavior](../requirements.md#provider-behavior) while adopting the selection interface introduced by [application provider selection](01-expand-composition.example) under the approved [provider composition seam](../design.md#provider-composition-seam).

## Touch points

Server composition root and startup behavior tests.

## Changes

1. Replace direct web construction with application selection.

## Constraints

Provider lifecycle and shutdown ordering remain unchanged.

## Done and verify

Server startup and shutdown preserve provider behavior; run `go test ./internal/...`.
